The complete BH2 T/S physical circuits, ideal circuits and task JSON in
bh-native-inputs.json are from itpyi/magna, revision
56847478c840395735146ef1e1ccdc3d8aedc10f, examples/bh2-T/ and examples/bh2-S/.
Their exact source paths and SHA-256 identities are retained in the fixture and
benchmarks/magna_reproduction/reference.json. The Rust runner tests and
independent code-weight analytical oracle are additions.

